  "//geometry": [
    "Carved out of one solid block of stone, Doom-style: brush 0 fills the whole",
    "3x3-chunk volume, brush 1 lays bedrock under it, and every space below is a",
    "CLEAR cut out of that mass, so a carve can never leak into a void.",
    "",
    "  R1 entry bay      x  6..26  z  6..24  floor y7  ceiling y17  (spawn)",
    "  S1 secret armoury x  1.. 4  z 14..18  behind a fake wall on the west side",
    "  C1 service duct   x 15..17  z 25..38  floor y7  ceiling y12  (dark)",
    "  R2 coolant hall   x  6..44  z 39..70  floor y7  ceiling y20  (lava vent, key deck)",
    "  D1 YELLOW DOOR    x 45      z 52..54  y 8..11",
    "  C2 airlock        x 46..56  z 52..54  floor y7  ceiling y12  (imp ambush)",
    "  R3 pump room      x 57..87  z 39..70  floor y7  ceiling y20  (exit + exit switch)",
    "  ST stair to duct  x 69..73  z 39..45  rises y8 -> y14 inside R3",
    "  C3 return duct    x 70..72  z 26..38  floor y14 ceiling y19",
    "  R4 catwalk        x 20..69  z 26..31  floor y14 ceiling y20  (backpack)",
    "  W1 one-way window x 21..23  z 25      y 15..17 -> a 7-block drop into R1",
    "",
    "The catwalk only runs one way: from R1 the window sits seven blocks up a",
    "sheer wall, so the exit in R3 is behind the yellow door and nothing else."
  ],

